---
// src/pages/index.astro
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Dr. Besen Roy Hull | Official Transmission Hub</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-mono min-h-screen p-6">
    <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-emerald-500/30 p-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/50 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/10">
      <div class="text-xs text-emerald-500 mb-4 border-b border-emerald-500/20 pb-2">
        // SYSTEM_STATUS: ONLINE // BEACON_ID: #481-B-HULL
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Dr. Besen Roy Hull</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">Chair of Non-Linear Galactic Narrative Strategy</p>
      <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Welcome, operative. You have successfully intercepted the official archive and transmission hub for Dr. Roy Hull's speculative fiction, non-linear research notes, and galactic logs.
      </p>
      <div class="inline-block bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm">
        > TRANSMISSION_ESTABLISHED
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
